Z||000000||MCFIEROGUY||09-01-2000||02:54 PM|||| <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"> Hey every body I recently bought an 86 se 2m6 for $100. it was in pretty bad shape but I have gand plans for this little beauty. It was sitting in a ditch for three months with oil pan off, rod caps off, exhaust cut up, engine bracket mysteriously missing, and the starter dangling from its wires. The interior is pretty trashed also. needless to say it was love at first sight. You would not believe how badly abused this fiero was but now 2 months later it is running although roughly. This is a very long term project and I , being a novice, am going to need a lot of help so thats my story more to come.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>------------------<BR>-Chris||||reg||10
